<title>UK: Korea Development Bank sets 70 bln yen Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Korea Development Bank sets 70 bln yen Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Nomura International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KOREA DEVELOPMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT     70 BLN YEN   COUPON     1.875     MATURITY    13.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    13.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.25	REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (M) 1-10-100  SALE LIMS US/UK/JP/KR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  KOREA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.15	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
